1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,840
Open Agent entitlements, and click Add agent entitlements.

2
00:00:08,316 --> 00:00:13,010
Click Browse users, search for the person, and pick them as the User.

3
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:18,706
Each user has one entitlement record, and the screen tells you if one already exists.

4
00:00:19,156 --> 00:00:23,690
Under Allowed queues, pick every queue the agent may sign in to.

5
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:27,576
Removing a queue later also signs the agent out of it.

6
00:00:28,027 --> 00:00:30,829
Queue preferences list the allowed queues.

7
00:00:30,829 --> 00:00:33,515
A lower Priority number is served first.

8
00:00:33,515 --> 00:00:38,069
Delay makes a caller wait that many seconds before this agent is offered

9
00:00:38,069 --> 00:00:40,697
work, so the agent can back up a queue.

